    "grammarFocus": "Formula: На основании (on the basis of)",
    "hints": [
      "This is a fixed formal/legal preposition meaning 'on the basis of.' Which preposition combines with 'основании'?"
    ],
    "explanations": [
      "'На основании' (on the basis of) is a fixed formal formula used in official documents and legal writing. It takes the genitive case: 'на основании изложенного' (on the basis of what was stated). This is distinct from 'в основе' (at the basis of) or 'по основанию' (which is not standard)."
    ],
    "options": [
      [
        "С",
        "На",
        "По",
        "В"
      ]
    ]
